WEBVTT

44:52.750 --> 44:55.042
You dozed off without listening to your
Mom completely when you were young.

44:55.167 --> 44:57.042
Now you're not letting me sleep in peace.

44:57.209 --> 44:58.209
I can't do this anymore.

44:58.667 --> 45:02.000
Only a miracle worker can
save you from this tragedy.
